    pr_ref:  # 7d8b
    description: "WI-fuvuj (PR #4322) added receiver-type inference for open()->file and socket.socket()->socket via py.py EXTERNAL_CONSTRUCTOR_TYPES + a synthetic 'file' catalog module. The map is the extension point; this item expands it to other stdlib constructor-returning I/O types so their method calls classify into the right boundary instead of external_potential: sqlite3.connect()->Connection (db_query), http.client.HTTPConnection/HTTPSConnection (net), tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile/TemporaryFile (fs), subprocess.Popen (subprocess pipes), urllib.request.urlopen result, etc. Each is an additive EXTERNAL_CONSTRUCTOR_TYPES entry + (where missing) a catalog module entry + tests. Also consider aliased constructors (from socket import socket as x) and binary/text-mode precision (open mode -> io.BufferedReader vs io.TextIOWrapper), both deferred from WI-fuvuj. Mechanism is proven; this is pure breadth."  # 7d8b
    fields: {}  # 7d8b
